---
// OfficialDocuments.astro
---

<div class="resources-col">
  <h2>Official Documents</h2>

  <p class="section-intro text-muted">
    Access a foundational introduction to accelerator physics and a curated
    list of recommended resources. This is a great starting point, but from
    here on, the sky is the limit: get ready to research and learn!
  </p>

  <div class="divider-inner"></div>

  <div class="doc-item">
    <h3 class="doc-title">Accelerator physics (student level)</h3>
    <p class="doc-desc text-muted">Descripción del documento, breve guión de contenido, etc.</p>
    <a class="btn btn-dark" href="#">Download document</a>
  </div>

  <div class="divider-inner"></div>

  <div class="doc-item">
    <h3 class="doc-title">CERN Website</h3>
    <p class="doc-desc text-muted">Descripción del documento, breve guión de contenido, etc.</p>
    <a class="btn btn-dark" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit Website</a>
  </div>

  <div class="divider-inner"></div>

  <div class="doc-item">
    <h3 class="doc-title">MOOC courses</h3>
    <p class="doc-desc text-muted">Descripción del documento, breve guión de contenido, etc.</p>
    <a class="btn btn-dark" href="#">Download document</a>
  </div>

  <div class="divider-inner"></div>

  <div class="doc-item">
    <h3 class="doc-title">Free Notes</h3>
    <p class="doc-desc text-muted">Descripción del documento, breve guión de contenido, etc.</p>
    <a class="btn btn-dark" href="#">Download document</a>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
.resources-col {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0;
}

.resources-col h2 {
  margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
}

.section-intro {
  font-size: 1rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
  max-width: 480px;
  margin-bottom: 0;
}

.divider-inner {
  width: 100%;
  height: 1px;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
  margin-block: 2rem;
}

.doc-item {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.75rem;
  align-items: flex-start;
}

.doc-title {
  font-family: var(--ff-body);
  font-size: var(--fs-h5);
  font-weight: 600;
  line-height: 1.3;
  color: var(--c-white);
}

.doc-desc {
  font-size: 1rem;
  line-height: 1.5;
  margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
}
</style>
